  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: river, Taman\u2019?</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient river mentioned by Ptolemy whose location cannot be determined with certainty today. BAtlDir tentatively suggests it may have been located in the area of modern Taman\u2019 i.e. at the west end of the ancient Hermonassa island in the Kerch Strait.",
